OL,3,GNEWSA'There wasn't an hour when we
OL,4,Adidn't come under attack' - MP reflects
OL,5,Aon trip to Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FComing under attack is nothing new for
OL,8,Farmy veteran Stuart Anderson. Yet the
OL,9,F"brutal" Russian drone and missile
OL,10,Fbombardment he experienced in Ukraine
OL,11,Ftook him by surprise.
OL,13,F"It was like being back in the
OL,14,Fmiliary," he told the BBC once back
OL,15,Ffrom a five-day trip to Kiev earlier
OL,16,Fthis month.
OL,18,F"I never had more than an hour's sleep
OL,19,Fat any one time, and some nights were
OL,20,Fspent in a basement car park taking
OL,21,Fshelter," he said.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
